"""1 November 2026, 22:10 : M22, THE VERIFIER OF A CUT SHEET received from an image model. A model cannot prove its own work, so a check written in the prompt only guides it : this one decides.
Each pixel is read as the palette colour most likely under a semi-transparent mask, then every disc of the colour index asks : does the piece under me carry my colour ? Writes 06_checks/cut_check.json, a board per image (green ring right, red ring wrong, with the expected number) and a map of where two generations differ.
    python -I MicroCutCheck.py Projects/<id>/params.json [image.png ...]      default : 04_received/gen_*.png and cut_sheet.png ; exit 0 if one image passes the gates
    python -I MicroCutCheck.py selftest Projects/<id>/params.json             green on a perfect sheet, red on swapped colours
Settings : cut_check in params.json, see DEF.
FR : le vérificateur d'une planche de découpe : un modèle ne peut pas prouver son propre travail, la vérification écrite dans le prompt le guide seulement, celle-ci tranche."""
